<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  PGPony Desktop — desktop-owned strings, Japanese.

  Terminology follows the vendored Android translation (キーリング, 鍵サーバー, クリップボード,
  パスフレーズ) and its ですます register, so the same app does not read differently on the two
  platforms. Machine-translated for D11 and queued for the native review triage tracked as
  PGPonyAndroid 4.1.0 §10 — correct freely, this file is desktop-owned and is never overwritten
  by a vendor sync.

  Japanese has no plural distinction, so <plurals> carries only `other` here — the same shape as
  the vendored Android ja file. trQuantity() falls back to `other` for every count.

  A key missing here falls back to the English in ../values/strings.xml.
-->
